{"id":"repo-a","title":"Repository access","summary":"Use the required capability for that specific repository","timing":"anytime","body":"Confirm the repository and required capability: $repository_scope\nRequest and verify it through $repository_grant_route.\n\nUse your intended account to perform a permitted operation that proves\nthe required capability. Reading does not prove write or merge authority;\na request does not prove access. Do not push a test change or grant broad\npermissions without approval. Configure separate section instances for\nrepositories with independent outcomes. Report wrong-account access or\nexcessive permissions to the grantor.","variables":[{"name":"repository_scope","description":"Which repository and exact capability does this activity cover?","type":"string","required":true,"audience":"onboarder"},{"name":"repository_grant_route","description":"Who grants this capability and what safe verification procedure applies?","type":"string","required":true,"audience":"onboarder"}],"steps":[{"id":"verify-repository-capability","name":"Verify the specific approved repository capability","checks":[{"ask":"Have you used the approved capability in the intended repository without exceeding its permission scope?"}]}]}
